              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti jabduuni, adabi keesani aka Oduuni Dansaani ta Kristo jettu ha jiraatu, aka ato anini d'ufe isani argu d'ibaad'ele, aka isani garaa tokooni jabaattani ejaanjattani yaada toko ch'allaani woliini haatani d'agayu, maro d'ugefacha odu dansaatiifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaapa keesani insodaatiina; hojja ch'ufa jannooma, wonti kunini aka isani worra dabsatani agarsiifti Waaqati dabsacha isanii kenna! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayyaana keesani ka, Kristo d'ugefad'a ch'alla isaniini injenne, ammo, Maro isaatiifi gaargala isaniini jed'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
